sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant Git as Git Repository<br/>(odh-gitops)
    participant Helm as Helm / Kustomize<br/>CLI
    participant OLM as OLM<br/>(OpenShift only)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server
    participant Operators as Provisioned Operators

    Note over Admin,Operators: OpenShift Deployment Flow (OLM-based)

    Admin->>Git: Clone odh-gitops repository
    Admin->>Helm: helm install rhai-on-openshift-chart<br/>OR kustomize build dependencies/
    Helm->>K8sAPI: Apply Subscription CRs<br/>(Kueue, JobSet, LWS, RHCL,<br/>cert-manager, OTel, Tempo, etc.)
    K8sAPI->>OLM: Subscription triggers<br/>operator installation
    OLM->>Operators: Install operator pods<br/>from CatalogSource
    Admin->>Helm: kustomize build configurations/
    Helm->>K8sAPI: Apply operator config CRs<br/>(Kuadrant CR, Authorino CR,<br/>Kueue config, etc.)
    K8sAPI->>Operators: Operators reconcile<br/>configuration resources

    Note over Admin,Operators: Non-OpenShift (XKS) Deployment Flow

    Admin->>Git: Clone odh-gitops repository
    Admin->>Helm: helm install rhai-on-xks-chart
    Helm->>K8sAPI: Install sub-charts directly<br/>(cert-manager, RHCL, Sail,<br/>Gateway API, LWS)
    K8sAPI->>Operators: Deploy operator workloads<br/>as Helm releases
    Helm->>K8sAPI: Apply post-install hooks<br/>(operator configurations)
    K8sAPI->>Operators: Operators reconcile<br/>configuration resources

    Note over Admin,Operators: Post-Deployment (Both Platforms)

    Operators->>K8sAPI: Watch for custom resources<br/>(InferenceService, Kuadrant,<br/>Authorino, etc.)
    Note right of Operators: Operators now manage<br/>their own runtime<br/>data flows independently
